{% call section("Background", "background") %}
<p>The background runs the same dynamics with a slower clock and a frame cap of 30 per second. It stops when the tab is hidden, and the orbit and its trace carry over to the next page in the same tab.</p>
<p>Text sits over the dimmed part of the background. The orbit, the trace and the tetrahedron are drawn in the chalk color; the moving light is red.</p>
<p>Paragraphs here exist only to give the page some length so that scrolling can be checked. The background is fixed to the viewport and does not scroll with the content.</p>
